:"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"embabel/coding-agent","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:09Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53c2c43891f24914a50283baeb120051"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0f540841658ad4f2e8469e01170476c4c134dd64ffe403b659f586d3a35204bb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Chat mode currently has no memory, so the agent does not remember the context of previous messages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_196af0fdc08a189eaf0614750c8f95dceb9fa8924dd6b0bf61eb82105bcb2877"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README states the project is in an early stage of development."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2a5b0d74d9911d16c5d50aea68b780c6bc38e70cf04b3499b8d49f0af9e27c32"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A chat command enters a chat mode where users can ask the agent to explain or modify code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5ddf70be75a26006df82bc177b04b43ca7e8700fd38f4e24b13b77bdc8dc4078"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"README badges suggest the technology stack involves Kotlin, Java, Spring, Apache Tomcat, and Maven, though badges alone do not confirm actual usage."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6cf838a593ba8a021993d093763cdc36c07a49f851d17bcd9d50d1c173724973"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stated aim is a full-fledged coding agent that accelerates the Embabel team's work without using any commercial coding agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7d56bd357706d9c8c13d6b411fd10864e5ef159ad895944b3bd9be3542b849dd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Planned future work includes supporting build systems other than Maven, better project selection, enhanced language support, reduced token usage, GitHub PR integration, automated PR review, and a possible chat mode during process flows."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9aa160e855a83bec389340a2f6f2b9239966a17f9680243c6dc2e8081424e1b3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Key capabilities listed include explaining code, creating new Embabel projects, making multi-file code changes, writing documentation, and combining project code access with internet research such as researching new APIs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a97310aa762f6b3bd9cd72f6443715e38f299027eecd5da9eb958d0dd24cb7ec"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The coder discovers Maven projects located under peer directories of the directory in which it is started."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b62aeab814afc99259da0486fff5da52a83a2ed54784570e9f6e8e8cfd51cd8c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is a headless coding agent built on the Embabel agent platform, intended both for developing Embabel and as a standalone open source project."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de22fbee5b8695bbe269102d25a8630a825b8a6ccb48ed5fd6515f18dcb66f49"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent is run via a shell offering commands such as set-focus <project> and focus to select or show the focused project, with some commands requiring double-quoted strings."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0f540841658ad4f2e8469e01170476c4c134dd64ffe403b659f586d3a35204bb","clm_196af0fdc08a189eaf0614750c8f95dceb9fa8924dd6b0bf61eb82105bcb2877","clm_2a5b0d74d9911d16c5d50aea68b780c6bc38e70cf04b3499b8d49f0af9e27c32","clm_5ddf70be75a26006df82bc177b04b43ca7e8700fd38f4e24b13b77bdc8dc4078","clm_6cf838a593ba8a021993d093763cdc36c07a49f851d17bcd9d50d1c173724973","clm_7d56bd357706d9c8c13d6b411fd10864e5ef159ad895944b3bd9be3542b849dd","clm_9aa160e855a83bec389340a2f6f2b9239966a17f9680243c6dc2e8081424e1b3","clm_a97310aa762f6b3bd9cd72f6443715e38f299027eecd5da9eb958d0dd24cb7ec","clm_b62aeab814afc99259da0486fff5da52a83a2ed54784570e9f6e8e8cfd51cd8c","clm_de22fbee5b8695bbe269102d25a8630a825b8a6ccb48ed5fd6515f18dcb66f49"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:09Z","created_by_operation":"op_53c2c43891f24914a50283baeb120051","id":"pg_fa17c482f3c6535e870f92c4d91f7b6a","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/embabel-coding-agent-readme-md-b0997231880d-92c4d91f7b6a.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_8518922d3bc05c4cb91aa206d6b6ca2d"],"title":"embabel/coding-agent/README.md @ b0997231880d","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:48:09Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53c2c43891f24914a50283baeb120051"}
